    "spirit": "Fantasy is the soul's first language, but it was meant to lead toward incarnation, not to replace it. Ask which vision will survive contact with reality.",
    "action": "Choose one cup and investigate it seriously before adding another option to the array. Discernment is this week's practice.",
    "the gift": "An embarrassment of creative possibilities — the gift of a richly imagining mind, even when it needs grounding.",
    "what to release": "Magical thinking that excuses inaction. Release the comfort of options that are never actually pursued.",
    "the seed": "Plant the intention to discern — to examine each desire not for its shimmer but for its substance.",
    "the obstacle": "Overwhelm and paralysis masquerading as abundance; so many visions that none of them can become real.",
